<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer - National league of Ireland premier fixtures.</title>
<headline>Soccer - National league of Ireland premier fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friday's national league of Ireland premier division fixtures are as follows. All kick-off times are given in gmt.</p>
<p>Friday, August 30</p>
<p>Bohemians versus Cork City at Dalymount Park,9 1845.</p>
<p>Dundalk versus St.Patrick's Athletic at Oriel Park, 1845.</p>
<p>Shamrock Rovers versus Shelbourne at Tolka Park, 1845.</p>
<p>-- Damien Lynch, Dublin Newsroom +353 1 6603377</p>
</text>
